msgid "Processing of rovibrational line lists (DAT2GR)"
msgstr "转动振动谱线列表处理（DAT2GR）"

msgid ""
"The DAT2GR program is used to process and to generate plots from "
"rovibrational infrared and Raman line lists generated by the RVCI program "
"that is part of the VCI program."
msgstr "DAT2GR 程序用于处理由 VCI 程序中的 RVCI 程序生成的转动振动红外和拉曼谱线列表，并从中生成图表。"

msgid "The DAT2GR program (DAT2GR)"
msgstr "DAT2GR 程序（DAT2GR）"

msgid ""
"The following example generates a rovibrational IR spectrum for the spectral"
" range between 900 and 1100 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}` for the given temperature of "
"300 K from the line list provided in the file ``H2CS_IR_VCI_J3.dat`` and "
"dumps the output to ``H2CS_IR_VCI_J3_graph.dat``."
msgstr ""
"以下示例为给定温度 300 K，从文件 ``H2CS_IR_VCI_J3.dat`` 中提供的谱线列表，在 900 到 1100 cm\\ "
":math:`^{-1}` 的光谱范围内生成一个转动振动红外光谱，并将输出转储到 ``H2CS_IR_VCI_J3_graph.dat``\\ 。"

msgid "``DAT2GR,options``"
msgstr "``DAT2GR,options``"

msgid ""
"The ``DAT2GR`` program allows for the processing of rovibrational line lists"
" (IR and Raman) to modify data, apply line-broadening and temperature "
"effects or generate plots. The file containing the line list must be "
"generated before by RVCI calculations. ``DAT2GR`` does not require any "
"``XSURF`` or ``VSCF`` calculations prior to its call, but requests at least "
"a Hartree-Fock calculation, which is always needed in Molpro. The following "
"*options* are available:"
msgstr ""
"``DAT2GR`` 程序可用于处理振转谱线列表（红外和拉曼），以修改数据、应用线展宽和温度效应或生成图形。包含谱线列表的文件必须事先由 RVCI "
"计算生成。\\ ``DAT2GR`` 在调用前不需要任何 ``XSURF`` 或 ``VSCF`` 计算，但至少需要 Hartree-Fock "
"计算，这在 Molpro 中总是必需的。以下\\ *选项*\\ 可用："

msgid ""
"**``DUMP``\\ =\\ *filename*** This keyword defines the name of the output "
"file to be generated."
msgstr "**``DUMP``\\ =\\ *\\ filename*** 此关键字定义要生成的输出文件的名称。"

msgid ""
"**``EINC``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 0.1 Default, in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`) Output "
"spectrum is calculated on a grid with width EINC; i.e. determines the "
"resolution of the x-Axis in the final spectrum."
msgstr ""
"**``EINC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0.1，单位 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ ）输出光谱在宽度为 EINC"
" 的网格上计算；即确定最终光谱中 x 轴的分辨率。"

msgid ""
"**``EMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 5000 Default, in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`) This "
"option specifies the maximum energy of the spectral range to be considered."
msgstr ""
"**``EMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 5000，单位 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ "
"）此选项指定要考虑的光谱范围的最大能量。"

msgid ""
"**``EMIN``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 0 Default, in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`) This option "
"specifies the minimum energy of the spectral range to be considered."
msgstr ""
"**``EMIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0，单位 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ "
"）此选项指定要考虑的光谱范围的最小能量。"

msgid ""
"**``EXTERN``\\ =\\ *filename*** This keyword is mandatory and requests the "
"input filename (rovibrational line list) as generated from the RVCI program."
msgstr "**``EXTERN``\\ =\\ *\\ filename*** 此关键字为必需项，指定输入文件名（由 RVCI 程序生成的振转谱线列表）。"

msgid ""
"**``GAMMA``\\ =\\ *value*** Mandatory keyword, if pressure broadening is "
"used. Describes the width of the Lorentz profile in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`. The "
"width can be determined by the equation: :math:`\\gamma = \\frac{p A}{\\pi "
"c}  \\sqrt{\\frac{2}{k_B T m}}`, with pressure :math:`p`, cross section of "
"the molecule :math:`A`, speed of light :math:`c`, Boltzmann constant "
":math:`k_B`, temperature :math:`T` and Molecular mass :math:`m`."
msgstr ""
"**``GAMMA``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 若使用压力展宽则为必需关键字。描述 Lorentz 线型的宽度，单位 cm\\ "
":math:`^{-1}`\\ 。该宽度可由以下方程确定：\\ :math:`\\gamma = \\frac{p A}{\\pi c}  "
"\\sqrt{\\frac{2}{k_B T m}}`\\ ，其中压力为 :math:`p`\\ ，分子截面为 :math:`A`\\ ，光速为 "
":math:`c`\\ ，Boltzmann 常数为 :math:`k_B`\\ ，温度为 :math:`T`\\ ，分子质量为 :math:`m`\\"
" 。"

msgid ""
"**``METHOD``\\ =\\ *string*** (=’INT’ Default) This option controls the "
"method of data handling, e.g. whether the data should be modified/filtered "
"or (re-)calculated. Options are ’MOD’ (modify/filter existing line list), "
"’INT’ (calculate T-dependent intensities from existing intensities at "
":math:`T=0` K), ’INT_TM’ (calculate Raman intensities from transition "
"moments :math:`R_0` and :math:`R_2` in the input line list)."
msgstr ""
"**``METHOD``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认 "
"’INT’）此选项控制数据处理的方法，例如数据应被修改/筛选还是（重新）计算。选项为 ’MOD’（修改/筛选现有谱线列表）、’INT’（根据 "
":math:`T=0` K 下的现有强度计算温度相关强度）、’INT_TM’（根据输入谱线列表中的跃迁矩 :math:`R_0` 和 "
":math:`R_2` 计算拉曼强度）。"

msgid ""
"**``PINC``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 0.1 atm Default, in ``PUNIT``) Pressure "
"increment to be considered. Only needed for Voigt profile."
msgstr ""
"**``PINC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0.1 atm，单位 ``PUNIT``\\ ）要考虑的压力增量。仅 Voigt "
"线型需要。"

msgid ""
"**``PLIST``\\ =\\ *string*** (off Default) List of pressures to be "
"considered, e.g. ’1.0,1.1,1.2’. Combinable with other pressure-keywords. "
"Only needed for Voigt profile."
msgstr ""
"**``PLIST``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认关闭）要考虑的压力列表，例如 "
"’1.0,1.1,1.2’。可与其他压力关键字组合使用。仅 Voigt 线型需要。"

msgid ""
"**``PMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 1.0 atm Default, in ``PUNIT``) Maximum "
"pressure to be considered. Only needed for Voigt profile."
msgstr ""
"**``PMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 1.0 atm，单位 ``PUNIT``\\ ）要考虑的最大压力。仅 Voigt "
"线型需要。"

msgid ""
"**``PMIN``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 1.0 atm Default, in ``PUNIT``) Minimum "
"pressure to be considered. Only needed for Voigt profile."
msgstr ""
"**``PMIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 1.0 atm，单位 ``PUNIT``\\ ）要考虑的最小压力。仅 Voigt "
"线型需要。"

msgid ""
"**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=0 (off) Default) ``PRINT=2`` enables additional "
"printout."
msgstr "**``PRINT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 0（关闭））\\ ``PRINT=2`` 启用额外输出。"

msgid ""
"**``PROFILE``\\ =\\ *string*** (=’GAUSSIAN’ Default) This option controls "
"the line shape to be used for accounting of line-broadening or in the case "
"of data modification/filtering (``METHOD=’MOD’``) what's to be done. "
"``PROFILE=’Lines’`` will return a line list again. ``PROFILE=’Lorentz’`` "
"sets the line shape to be Lorentzians, ``PROFILE=’Gauss’`` will use "
"Gaussians. ``PROFILE=’Voigt’`` specifies a line shape from numerical "
"convolution of Gaussians and Lorentzians, which is numerically expensive. "
"The combined half-widths :math:`\\sigma` for the Gaussian and "
":math:`\\gamma` for the Lorentzian line shape are calculated from the "
"temperature and pressure using a physical description. "
"``PROFILE=’Gaussian’`` specifies a simple Gaussian line shape with half-"
"width ``SIGMA``. For ``METHOD=’MOD’`` the options are ``PROFILE=’SORT’`` to "
"sort the data by the column specified with the keyword ``SORT`` or "
"``PROFILE=’SYMSEL’`` to apply symmetry selection rules."
msgstr ""
"**``PROFILE``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认 "
"’GAUSSIAN’）此选项控制用于考虑线展宽的线型，或在数据修改/筛选（\\ ``METHOD=’MOD’``\\ ）情况下要执行的操作。\\ "
"``PROFILE=’Lines’`` 将再次返回谱线列表。\\ ``PROFILE=’Lorentz’`` 将线型设为 Lorentzian "
"线型，\\ ``PROFILE=’Gauss’`` 将使用 Gaussian 线型。\\ ``PROFILE=’Voigt’`` 指定由 "
"Gaussian 和 Lorentzian 数值卷积得到的线型，其数值计算开销较大。Gaussian 的合成半宽 :math:`\\sigma` 和 "
"Lorentzian 线型的合成半宽 :math:`\\gamma` 通过物理描述由温度和压力计算得出。\\ "
"``PROFILE=’Gaussian’`` 指定具有半宽 ``SIGMA`` 的简单 Gaussian 线型。对于 "
"``METHOD=’MOD’``\\ ，选项为 ``PROFILE=’SORT’`` 以按关键字 ``SORT`` 指定的列对数据排序，或 "
"``PROFILE=’SYMSEL’`` 以应用对称性选择定则。"

msgid ""
"**``PUNIT``\\ =\\ *string*** (=’atm’ Default) Pressure unit, without any "
"broadening."
msgstr "**``PUNIT``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认 ’atm’）压力单位，不进行任何展宽。"

msgid ""
"**``RAMAN_FAC(n)``\\ =\\ *value*** Set the prefactors for the isotropic and "
"anisotropic Raman transition moments for the calculation of Raman "
"intensities manually. :math:`n=0` will set the value for :math:`R_0`, "
":math:`n=2` the one for :math:`R_2`."
msgstr ""
"**``RAMAN_FAC(n)``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** 手动设置用于计算拉曼强度的各向同性和各向异性拉曼跃迁矩的前因子。\\ "
":math:`n=0` 将设置 :math:`R_0` 的值，\\ :math:`n=2` 设置 :math:`R_2` 的值。"

msgid ""
"**``RAMAN_LFREQ``\\ =\\ *value*** (=680 Default, in nm) Raman exciting "
"radiation (laser) frequency."
msgstr "**``RAMAN_LFREQ``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 680，单位 nm）拉曼激发辐射（激光）频率。"

msgid ""
"**``RAMAN_POLANG``\\ =\\ *value*** (=90 Default) Raman polarization angle "
"defining the prefactors mixing the isotropic and anisotropic Raman "
"transition moments for the calculation of Raman intensities."
msgstr ""
"**``RAMAN_POLANG``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 "
"90）拉曼偏振角，定义用于计算拉曼强度时混合各向同性和各向异性拉曼跃迁矩的前因子。"

msgid ""
"**``SIGMA``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 1.0 Default, in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`) Mandatory"
" keyword, if Doppler broadening is used. Describes the width of the Gaussian"
" profile in cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`. The width can be determined by the equation:"
" :math:`\\sigma = \\frac{1}{c}  \\sqrt{\\frac{8 k_B T ln(2)}{m}}`, with "
"speed of light :math:`c`, Boltzmann constant :math:`k_B`, temperature "
":math:`T` and Molecular mass :math:`m` and natural logarithm."
msgstr ""
"**``SIGMA``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 1.0，单位 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ ）若使用 Doppler "
"展宽则为必需关键字。描述 Gaussian 线型的宽度，单位 cm\\ :math:`^{-1}`\\ 。该宽度可由以下方程确定：\\ "
":math:`\\sigma = \\frac{1}{c}  \\sqrt{\\frac{8 k_B T ln(2)}{m}}`\\ ，其中光速为 "
":math:`c`\\ ，Boltzmann 常数为 :math:`k_B`\\ ，温度为 :math:`T`\\ ，分子质量为 :math:`m`\\"
" ，自然对数为 ln。"

msgid ""
"**``SORT``\\ =\\ *n*** (=12 (frequencies) Default) ``PRINT=2`` enables "
"additional printout."
msgstr "**``SORT``\\ =\\ *\\ n*** （默认 12（频率））\\ ``PRINT=2`` 启用额外输出。"

msgid ""
"**``TINC``\\ =\\ *value*** (= 100 Default, in K) Temperature increment to be"
" considered. Only needed for Voigt profile."
msgstr "**``TINC``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 100，单位 K）要考虑的温度增量。仅 Voigt 线型需要。"

msgid ""
"**``TLIST``\\ =\\ *string*** (off Default, in K) List of temperatures to be "
"considered, e.g. ’200,250,300’. Combinable with other temperature-keywords. "
"Only needed for Voigt profile."
msgstr ""
"**``TLIST``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认关闭，单位 K）要考虑的温度列表，例如 "
"’200,250,300’。可与其他温度关键字组合使用。仅 Voigt 线型需要。"

msgid ""
"**``TMAX``\\ =\\ *value*** (=0 (off) Default, in K) Maximum temperature to "
"be considered. Setting only ``TMIN`` will set ``TMAX`` to the same value. "
"Only needed for Voigt profile."
msgstr ""
"**``TMAX``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0（关闭），单位 K）要考虑的最高温度。仅设置 ``TMIN`` 会将 "
"``TMAX`` 设为相同值。仅 Voigt 线型需要。"

msgid ""
"**``TMIN``\\ =\\ *value*** (=0 (off) Default, in K) Minimum temperature to "
"be considered. Setting only ``TMAX`` will set ``TMIN`` to the same "
"value.Only needed for Voigt profile."
msgstr ""
"**``TMIN``\\ =\\ *\\ value*** （默认 0（关闭），单位 K）要考虑的最低温度。仅设置 ``TMAX`` 会将 "
"``TMIN`` 设为相同值。仅 Voigt 线型需要。"

msgid ""
"**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *string*** (=’IR’ Default) This option controls the type of"
" line list to be handled, but it will be set according to the input line "
"list type anyway. Options are ’IR’ or ’Raman’."
msgstr ""
"**``TYPE``\\ =\\ *\\ string*** （默认 "
"’IR’）此选项控制要处理的谱线列表类型，但无论如何都将根据输入谱线列表类型进行设置。选项为 ’IR’ 或 ’Raman’。"
